1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,817
Speaking, task three. Story number 15: Fixing the bike. What did Denis do with his dad on Saturday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:13,666
What did Denis do with his dad on Saturday?

3
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:38,467
On Saturday Denis wanted to ride his bike, but the tyre was flat.

4
00:00:38,667 --> 00:00:40,896
He was sad because he couldn't ride.

5
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,365
He told his dad.

6
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:45,832
Dad and Denis went to a sports shop.

7
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:48,300
There they bought a new inner tube and a pump.

8
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,885
Then they fixed the bike together in front of the house.

9
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,017
Dad changed the tube and Denis pumped up the tyre.

10
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:55,967
Finally the bike was fine.

11
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:58,167
Denis rode his bike down the street.

12
00:00:58,367 --> 00:01:00,724
He was very happy and thanked his dad.

13
00:01:00,933 --> 00:01:09,957
Tell story 15 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
